“"Nu" handkerchief.

00:19:38.678 --> 00:19:42.882
- Now prepare yourself, Rock Star!
- Yes, yes, yes, yes! Shake it up, baby! Hey!

00:19:42.882 --> 00:19:44.950
Bye! Baby! Hey!

00:19:45.685 --> 00:19:46.686
