00:19:50.589 --> 00:19:52.358
I guess I'll take you on instead!

00:19:55.561 --> 00:19:57.063
I'll be your opponent!

00:19:57.063 --> 00:19:59.398
How about that?
You know the twin-sword style?

00:19:59.398 --> 00:20:02.034
