entire restaurant!

00:20:33.399 --> 00:20:34.567
May I take your order?

00:20:34.567 --> 00:20:35.801
One Egypt, please.

00:20:35.968 --> 00:20:37.503
One Egypt coming up!

00:20:37.503 --> 00:20:38.104
Urgh!

00:20:38.104 --> 00:20:39.071
And flop!

00:20:39.739 --> 00:20:42.541
It's time to finish you off!
I'll throw you in now!

00:20:42.541 --> 00:20:43.976
Long-held grudge!

00:20:44.543 --> 00:20:46.011
Now for Tennosuke!

00:20:46.011 --> 00:20:47.146
Right, let's drop him in!

00:20:47.146 --> 00:20:47.813
Sure!

00:20:48.147 --> 00:20:52.251
