Dengaku Punch to save you!

00:20:52.251 --> 00:20:55.287
You meanie, you meanie,
you meanie, you meanie...

00:20:55.654 --> 00:20:57.256
Defeated

00:20:57.256 --> 00:20:59.258
Defeated
I surrender!

