| accidentally hit Bo-bobo back there!

00:21:16.041 --> 00:21:18.110
What a fearsome technique!

00:21:18.477 --> 00:21:21.113
And where do you think you're looking?

00:21:21.247 --> 00:21:23.115
That's nothing!
Combined Secret Technique:

00:21:23.115 --> 00:21:23.149
Nosehair Dengaku Shot!! That's
nothing! Combined Secret Technique:

00:21:23.149 --> 00:21:27.052
