Double Super Dengaku Punchl!I!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.856
Double Super Dengaku Punchl!I!
Accidental Double Super Dengaku Punch!

00:21:30.856 --> 00:21:31.090
Accidental Double Super Dengaku Punch!

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:33.292
Not so fast, Bo-bobo!

00:21:33.292 --> 00:21:36.362
Look over here. Don't you care
