00:21:50.242 --> 00:21:53.245
Improvised combination
attacks can't compare to ours!

00:21:53.245 --> 00:21:53.312
Mouth Kick!

00:21:53.312 --> 00:21:54.313
Mouth Kick!!!
Mouth Kick!

00:21:54.313 --> 00:21:56.515
Mouth Kick!!!
That's an amazing technique!

00:21:56.515 --> 00:21:56.782
That's an amazing technique!

00:21:57.616 --> 00:21:58.884
How was that?

00:21:59.151 --> 00:22:00.186
| didn't feel a thing.

00:22:00.186 --> 00:22:04.190
Because your attacks
lack care for one another!

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:06.492
