Ultimate Combination Secret Technique:

00:22:17.269 --> 00:22:20.706
Our Friendship Lasts Forever!!!!
Our Friendship Lasts Forever!

00:22:24.109 --> 00:22:25.678
You made me get dizzy!

00:22:25.678 --> 00:22:28.881
He's just having fun at our expense!

00:22:28.881 --> 00:22:29.782
Dengakuman,

00:22:29.782 --> 00:22:33.152
because you pulled off that combination
move, I consider you a friend.

00:22:33.452 --> 00:22:36.121
Take this as a symbol
of our friendship.

00:22:37.256 --> 00:22:38.324
I don't want it!

00:22:38.557 --> 00:22:41.493
It's a play-dough
sculpture I made of you.

00:22:41.493 --> 00:22:42.795
That's supposed to be me!/?

00:22:44.296 --> 00:22:46.498
Fools! You turned your backs on us!

00:22:46.498 --> 00:22:47.833
Die, Bo-bobo!

00:22:47.833 --> 00:22:49.235
Take that!

00:22:49.235 --> 00:22:51.570
Now that we're together,
we're invincible!

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:53.672
Invincible!

00:22:54.139 --> 00:22:54.773
He's scary!

00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:00.112
Tennosuke and Heppokomaru fell inside.

00:23:04.383 --> 00:23:06.886
What's going on?
My body suddenly bloated up!

00:23:06.886 --> 00:23:10.923
Am I giving birth? But I'm
supposed to be a guy...

00:23:11.323 --> 00:23:12.625
What's going on?

00:23:12.625 --> 00:23:15.160
That's right. I forgot
to explain this stage.

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:17.263
This is a special kind of water.

00:23:17.429 --> 00:23:20.165
Whoever's soaked in
it will start to inflate.

00:23:20.165 --> 00:23:22.635
And if they're in
there for ten minutes...

00:23:23.235 --> 00:23:26.472
their bodies will explode
and be blown to pieces!

00:23:28.874 --> 00:23:30.476
That happened way too quick!

00:23:30.476 --> 00:23:33.212
This is scary!
This is really frightening!

00:23:33.212 --> 00:23:35.915
Can anything so terrifying ever be legal?

00:23:35.915 --> 00:23:38.317
Will it be the end for Heppokomaru?

00:23:38.317 --> 00:23:40.853
And what happened to Tennosuke?

00:23:42.087 --> 00:23:42.554
Huh?

00:23:42.554 --> 00:23:43.689
I see he's back already!

00:23:43.689 --> 00:23:47.059
Anyway, my heart's
swelling for the next episode!

00:23:47.059 --> 00:23:50.162
No, my entire body!

00:24:00.372 --> 00:24:04.677
When the cherry
blossoms bloom, I remember...

00:24:04.677 --> 00:24:10.282
...the gentle dawn that
will never come back.

00:24:11.650 --> 00:24:15.988
| used to wish I would be hurt,

00:24:15.988 --> 00:24:22.628
because I thought being
hurt would make me happy.

00:24:22.628 --> 00:24:25.631
I lost things and broke things...

00:24:25.631 --> 00:24:28.100
I understood so many things

00:24:28.100 --> 00:24:33.973
This year the cherry
blossoms will sway too!

00:24:33.973 --> 00:24:41.180
My hazy feelings will
disappear with the wind.

00:24:42.414 --> 00:24:45.184
What was I drawing again...

00:24:45.184 --> 00:24:48.087
...that had so much hate in it?

00:24:48.087 --> 00:24:51.323
How many times will I go in circles...

00:24:51.957 --> 00:24:53.625
...before I understand
what weakness is?

00:24:53.625 --> 00:24:56.395
I'm struggling and crying again,

00:24:56.395 --> 00:24:59.531
but that doesn't mean
I can't keep going!

00:25:00.366 --> 00:25:02.568
To the future ahead of us

00:25:11.944 --> 00:25:14.413
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo

00:25:15.881 --> 00:25:19.051
The Five Ultimate Assassins
sure are strong.

00:25:19.051 --> 00:25:21.286
We have no choice. We have to...

00:25:21.620 --> 00:25:22.388
Is he serious!?

00:25:22.388 --> 00:25:24.123
He's going to do that!?

00:25:24.123 --> 00:25:25.391
What's he gonna do?

00:25:25.491 --> 00:25:28.060
Combination! Bo-bobo Fusion!

00:25:28.060 --> 00:25:29.895
Bobopatch is gonna
come back again!

00:25:30.162 --> 00:25:31.997
Next time on Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo:

00:25:31.997 --> 00:25:32.064
Go! Bobopatchnosukel!
On a Granny Bike!I! Seriously!?

00:25:32.064 --> 00:25:35.868
Go! Bobopatchnosukel! On a Granny Bike!!!I Seriously!?
Go! Bobopatchnosuke! On a Granny Bike! Seriously!?

